In other words,

257
00:16:36,810 --> 00:16:38,440
as long as I get a kick out of it,

258
00:16:39,100 --> 00:16:40,380
that's all I care about.

259
00:17:02,430 --> 00:17:03,510
My house?!

260
00:17:17,970 --> 00:17:19,070
He's tough!

261
00:17:20,490 --> 00:17:22,120
What the hell are you?

262
00:17:22,910 --> 00:17:27,640
"What" am I? That's rude.
We are the true earthlings.

263
00:17:27,930 --> 00:17:28,900
We?

264
00:17:29,390 --> 00:17:32,990
I believe you call us
"Subterraneans."

265
00:17:34,020 --> 00:17:36,030
We suffer from overpopulation.

266
00:17:36,670 --> 00:17:39,760
Therefore, we must now
claim the world above ground.

267
00:17:40,900 --> 00:17:43,780
I understand that there are
many people on the surface too.

268
00:17:44,060 --> 00:17:46,340
As it stands, you are in our way.

269
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:51,850
That is why we have decided
to eradicate you all.

270
00:17:53,040 --> 00:17:55,530
Since our invasion commenced,

271
00:17:55,550 --> 00:17:58,780
70% of the surface dwellers
have been killed.

272
00:17:59,180 --> 00:18:00,830
This is a battle for survival.

273
00:18:01,120 --> 00:18:03,880
I hope you can understand that.

274
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:07,530
However, this is unexpected.

275
00:18:07,660 --> 00:18:09,410
We have encountered
no surface dwellers

276
00:18:09,410 --> 00:18:10,620
whom our punches would not kill.

277
00:18:10,770 --> 00:18:12,830
I'd like to state the same.

278
00:18:13,150 --> 00:18:16,730
It's been too long since
I've come across such worthy opponents,

279
00:18:16,820 --> 00:18:18,060
Subterraneans!

280
00:18:20,070 --> 00:18:22,050
We are earthlings!

281
00:18:30,530 --> 00:18:32,060
But how?!

282
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:34,080
You bastard!

283
00:18:38,290 --> 00:18:39,620
Die!

284
00:19:31,560 --> 00:19:32,940
It's over.

285
00:19:34,300 --> 00:19:37,920
What was that surface dweller?

286
00:19:38,080 --> 00:19:39,220
I'm...

287
00:19:39,990 --> 00:19:42,810
just a guy who's a hero for fun.

288
00:19:43,780 --> 00:19:45,490
I cannot lose!

289
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:47,790
And the surface...

290
00:19:48,570 --> 00:19:50,110
is under my protection!

291
00:19:52,010 --> 00:19:54,770
Big talk for a race of vermin!

292
00:20:09,220 --> 00:20:11,970
What is this feeling?

293
00:20:13,320 --> 00:20:15,140
This wild throbbing in my heart?!

294
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:19,470
This rush,

295
00:20:20,040 --> 00:20:21,660
this tension!

296
00:20:28,410 --> 00:20:30,240
It's been so long, I forgot...

297
00:20:31,970 --> 00:20:32,770
...the...

298
00:20:33,800 --> 00:20:35,970
...exhilaration of a real fight!

299
00:20:50,050 --> 00:20:50,980
I see.

300
00:20:51,530 --> 00:20:52,980
It's coming back to me.

301
00:20:53,580 --> 00:20:54,470
This is it.

302
00:20:54,570 --> 00:20:55,980
Well, well...

303
00:20:56,770 --> 00:21:01,630
Looks like you've been taking
good care of my children.

304
00:21:02,010 --> 00:21:03,080
This is it!

305
00:21:03,630 --> 00:21:07,260
I, the Subterranean King,
will take you on.

306
00:21:08,570 --> 00:21:09,860
This is the very feeling...

307
00:21:11,280 --> 00:21:13,050
...I've been looking for!

308
00:21:29,660 --> 00:21:31,280
The surface is ours!

309
00:21:31,690 --> 00:21:33,920
You surface dwellers must die!

310
00:21:34,240 --> 00:21:36,000
I am the Subterranean King!

311
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:38,830
Surface dwellers,
prepare yourselves for—

312
00:21:45,620 --> 00:21:47,420
All right, bring it on!

313
00:21:48,250 --> 00:21:49,290
Sorry about that

314
00:21:49,290 --> 00:21:52,010
Sorry about that

315
00:22:02,760 --> 00:22:04,630
I've become too strong.

